{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id175756270"}, "name":{"label":"May4683"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-22T01:34:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"13169201731"}, "title":{"label":"New update!"}, "content":{"label":"Not sure what you’ve done with the update but the app is now very hard to use - the current podcast overlays the bottom of the screen, making selecting the last podcast in the list, or playing the last on the list very hard - you have to tap it just right to get around the overlay.  Also the minimising button often doesn’t work - difficult to tap.  Was good before this update!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id289097684"}, "name":{"label":"WirlOfWirls"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-20T13:13:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"13162887349"}, "title":{"label":"No Longer Recommended for VoiceOver Users"}, "content":{"label":"I've subscribed to Overcast for some years now so it deeply saddens me to write this review, especially because I have tried to contact the developer without response. I understand that all apps have to be rewritten eventually as code reaches obsolescence, so I've waited a year before writing this. Since the rewrite last year, accessibility with VoiceOver has gone a long way downhill, now some features are inaccessible for VoiceOver users. With every new version release, more features become unusable without sighted assistance, so I cannot recommend that future VoiceOver users try Overcast. Since the rewrite last year I optimistically kept my subscription, but now it's about to be renewed I'm not so sure it's worth continuing to support a developer who has neglected to stick with their accessibility standards they once upheld without fail.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
