{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id1060628889"}, "name":{"label":"abcdef1234j"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-17T16:22:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8.1"}, "id":{"label":"11622313839"}, "title":{"label":"Update seems to have broken functionality"}, "content":{"label":"App update in Aug 2024 seems to have broken usability. \n\nPlaylists break when new episodes download but only when I can actually get something to download at all.\n\nPodcasts I follow update automatically when new episodes drop but when I add a new show or try to download selected older episodes they show as “cancel download” as if they are downloading but aren’t available when the app is offline. \n\nIt used to be easy from the Home Screen to see which episodes had updated but this function seems to have disappeared and now I need to view “downloaded” list or open each podcast individually.\n\nI guess that’s the basics that aren’t working well. I’ve switched to another player after 4-5 years of Overcast.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id113112925"}, "name":{"label":"Joey6756"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-17T03:10:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8.1"}, "id":{"label":"11620049710"}, "title":{"label":"Best player!"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast just does all the things the others should do, and does it without the corporate overlord. My most used app the last 3 years & I expect it will be for many more. Thank you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id114099829"}, "name":{"label":"Monza27"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-15T13:36:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8.1"}, "id":{"label":"11614272749"}, "title":{"label":"Great app keeps getting better"}, "content":{"label":"New app was a bit of an adjustment but now loving it. Just when I was thinking of trying to let the dev know that auto deletion after 24 hours is broken then it was fixed, sure enough in the patch notes. Both my wife and I will renew our sub. Keep up the great work!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id149608239"}, "name":{"label":"Treehugga-NZ"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-11T02:02:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8.1"}, "id":{"label":"11596733336"}, "title":{"label":"Latest update is terrible! Go back please"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used this app for. years. It WAS way better than apple podcast app, spotify, etc. i USED TO love it. \n\nSadly it “updated” recently. Awful. Putting aside the ridiculously jumbled UI they introduced, it\nNow wont play until it downloads, so makes it sllllooooooowww. Sleep timer is hidden away. \n\nIf its not rolled back in a week Im out. \n\n2 stars cos grateful for what it has been. One star for what it is now.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id42362223"}, "name":{"label":"JeffCGD"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-10T17:16:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8.1"}, "id":{"label":"11595561340"}, "title":{"label":"Arguably the best Podcast client gets even better"}, "content":{"label":"Update: Excellent, high performance refresh to an already excellent app. Happy to be a subscriber too. \n\nContinues to be excellent, with significant improvements and further battery life optimizations, plus added features for Patrons (dark mode etc). Still my favourite podcast client for ANY price, and I've tried MANY. Excellent defaults, and superbly well considered user experience. Marco shows how good boutique software can be.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
