{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id390419198"}, "name":{"label":"DeeM838"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-03T19:56:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11569649372"}, "title":{"label":"The best podcast app"}, "content":{"label":"Been best in class for years, and I’ve been a paying customer for years\n\nRecent redesign improved performance, reliability and UX modernity. Looks good. Feels faster.\n\nRequests;\n- chapter note icon would be great to make bigger, so I can see it under my fat fingers. Would prefer it on right side per previous muscle memory of old design\n- ability to delete a podcast while playing (current flow to delete from the now playing screen is hard to figure out. I rarely listen to the end of some podcasts which bundle in ads at the end)\n- clearer ability to see all of a show’s episodes from the now playing screen. Current redesign I can’t figure that out\n\nOverall this remains the best and definitive podcast app, across any OS. That one person makes it is all the more remarcoable. Highly recommended despite minor nitpicks above\n-", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
